{"unit_id":"tag:022H:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是反变函子（contravariant functor），定义在概形（schemes）的范畴（category）上，取值于集合（sets）。则<MATH_0002>对 fpqc 拓扑（fpqc topology）满足层性质（sheaf property），当且仅当它满足：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 对每个 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering）满足层性质（sheaf property），且\n<STRUCT_0003> 对任意标准 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）满足层性质（sheaf property）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n此外，在 (1) 成立时，性质 (2) 等价（equivalent）于性质：\n<STRUCT_0005>\n<ITEMOPEN_0001>(2')<ITEMCLOSE_0001> 对<MATH_0003>满足层性质（sheaf property），其中<MATH_0004>、<MATH_0005>仿射（affine），且<MATH_0006>忠实平坦（faithfully flat）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"contravariant functor","target_term":"反变函子"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc 拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaf property","target_term":"层性质"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"sheaf property","target_term":"层性质"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"sheaf property","target_term":"层性质"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"sheaf property","target_term":"层性质"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"contravariant functor","target_term":"反变函子","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc 拓扑","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sheaf property","target_term":"层性质","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fpqc covering","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_