{"unit_id":"tag:0ETA:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nV 拓扑（topology）比本章所有其他拓扑（topologies）更强。粗略地说，它由 Zariski 覆盖（coverings）和满足特化（specializations）提升性质（lifting property）的拟紧（quasi-compact）态射（morphisms）生成（引理<REF_0001>）。不过，我们定义 V 覆盖（coverings）的步骤稍有不同。先定义仿射概形（affines）的标准 V 覆盖（coverings），再用它们定义一般的 V 覆盖（coverings）。关于字体的说明：文献中有时用“<MATH_0001>-覆盖（covering）”代替“V 覆盖（covering）”。\n\n","allowed_english":["V","Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"specializations","target_term":"特化"},{"source_term":"lifting property","target_term":"提升性质"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"specializations","target_term":"特化","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"lifting property","target_term":"提升性质","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0ETB:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个仿射概形（affine scheme）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>标准 V 覆盖（standard V covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是有限（finite）族（family）<MATH_0002>，其中<MATH_0003>仿射（affine），使得对每个态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>，其中<MATH_0005>为赋值（valuation）环（ring），都存在赋值（valuation）环（rings）的扩张（extension）<MATH_0006>（《代数（Algebra）再论》定义<REF_0001>）、指标（index）<MATH_0007>和交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0008>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"standard V covering","target_term":"标准 V 覆盖"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"valuation","target_term":"赋值"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"valuation","target_term":"赋值"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"index","target_term":"指标"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"standard V covering","target_term":"标准 V 覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"valuation","target_term":"赋值","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"index","target_term":"指标","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
