{"unit_id":"tag:0ETD:proof","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个仿射概形（affine scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是固有（proper）满射（surjective）态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0003>是有限（finite）仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）。须证明<MATH_0004>是标准 V 覆盖（covering），见定义<REF_0001>。设<MATH_0005>是态射（morphism），其中<MATH_0006>为赋值（valuation）环（ring），分式域（fraction field）为<MATH_0007>。由于<MATH_0008>满射（surjective），可选择域（field）扩张（extension）<MATH_0009>和交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0010>。由《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0002>，可选择赋值（valuation）环（ring）<MATH_0011>，支配（dominating）<MATH_0012>。由固有性的赋值判据（valuative criterion of properness）（《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0003>），可在交换图（commutative diagram）中找到态射（morphism）<MATH_0013>，该图为<MATH_0014>。由于<MATH_0015>具有唯一闭点（closed point），可知<MATH_0016>包含在<MATH_0017>中，对于某个<MATH_0018>。因此，<MATH_0019>是所需的提升（lift），得出<MATH_0020>是标准 V 覆盖（covering）。\n","allowed_english":["V"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"valuation","target_term":"赋值"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"fraction field","target_term":"分式域"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"valuation","target_term":"赋值"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"dominating","target_term":"支配"},{"source_term":"valuative criterion of properness","target_term":"固有性的赋值判据"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"closed point","target_term":"闭点"},{"source_term":"lift","target_term":"提升"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"valuation","target_term":"赋值","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fraction field","target_term":"分式域","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"dominating","target_term":"支配","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"valuative criterion of properness","target_term":"固有性的赋值判据","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"closed point","target_term":"闭点","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"lift","target_term":"提升","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
