{"unit_id":"tag:0ETJ:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 若<MATH_0002>是同构（isomorphism），则<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>的 V 覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0005>是 V 覆盖（covering），且对每个<MATH_0006>有 V 覆盖（covering）<MATH_0007>，则<MATH_0008>是 V 覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若<MATH_0009>是 V 覆盖（covering），且<MATH_0010>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphism），则<MATH_0011>是 V 覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":["V"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0ETJ:proof","translation":"断言 (1) 是清楚的。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n证明 (3)。设<MATH_0001>是仿射开（affine open）子概形（subscheme）。由于<MATH_0002>拟紧（quasi-compact），可找到有限（finite）仿射开集（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0003>，使得<MATH_0004>映入（maps）仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0005>。选择标准 V 覆盖（covering）<MATH_0006>细化（refining）<MATH_0007>。由引理<REF_0001>，基变换（base change）<MATH_0008>是标准 V 覆盖（covering）。注意<MATH_0009>是标准 V 覆盖（covering）（例如由引理<REF_0002>）。由引理<REF_0003>，族（family）<MATH_0010>是标准 V 覆盖（covering）。由于<MATH_0011>细化（refines）<MATH_0012>，得到结论。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n证明 (2)。设<MATH_0013>是仿射开集（affine open）。先选取标准 V 覆盖（covering）<MATH_0014>细化（refining）<MATH_0015>。设该细化（refinement）由态射（morphisms）<MATH_0016>给出，它们在<MATH_0017>之上。则<MATH_0018>是 V 覆盖（covering），由 (3) 得到。由于<MATH_0019>仿射（affine），可找到标准 V 覆盖（covering）<MATH_0020>细化（refining）此族（family）。然后应用引理<REF_0004>，可见<MATH_0021>是标准 V 覆盖（covering），细化（refines）<MATH_0022>。证明完毕。\n","allowed_english":["V"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开"},{"source_term":"subscheme","target_term":"子概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映入"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refining","target_term":"细化"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"细化"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refining","target_term":"细化"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"细化"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refining","target_term":"细化"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"细化"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"subscheme","target_term":"子概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映入","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"refining","target_term":"细化","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"细化","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"细化","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
